<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - West Valley City, Utah, issue.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - West Valley City, Utah, issue.</headline>
<text>
<p>MUNICIPAL BUILDING AUTHORITY OF WEST VALLEY CITY</p>
<p>RE: $34,150,000</p>
<p>SALT LAKE COUNTY, UTAH</p>
<p>TAXABLE LEASE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(WEST VALLEY EVENT CENTER PROJECT)</p>
<p>SERIES 1996 A</p>
<p>Effective at 9:00 A.M. E.D.T., Friday, October 11, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>Dain Bosworth Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
